      "title": "Sort and evaluate the combined samples",
      "explanation": "The fine sample set changes from two new draws to the ordered union $t_A,f_1,t_B,f_2,t_C$. The far endpoint $t_F$ remains an interval boundary rather than a field query. The fine field with parameters $\\Theta_f$ evaluates every query position; its density depends only on position, while its emitted color also uses the unchanged direction $\\mathbf d$. All coarse and added depth identities persist.",
